(6454142, 958561, 10785, '<td valign="top">Such a captivating title goes well with the image. The darkness overtaking the light, led by the bird in flight. What great storytelling imagery and such awesome symbolism! To me the technicals are good, but the storyline gets all the marks on this work of art!!</td>', 'Such a captivating title goes well with the image. The darkness overtaking the light, led by the bird in flight. What great storytelling imagery and such awesome symbolism! To me the technicals are good, but the storyline gets all the marks on this work of art!!', '2011-06-27 14:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6454147, 958460, 10785, '<td valign="top">I have been looking up to the sky a lot these days seeing the wonderful light that streams from behind the clouds. I love your capture here and am jealous because I can''t make it work. I want to know your secrets and I will be checking out this image at the end of the challenge to ask you about it. Hopefully you will share some tips!</td>', 'I have been looking up to the sky a lot these days seeing the wonderful light that streams from behind the clouds. I love your capture here and am jealous because I can''t make it work. I want to know your secrets and I will be checking out this image at the end of the challenge to ask you about it. Hopefully you will share some tips!', '2011-06-27 14:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6454148, 958557, 10785, '<td valign="top">Superblurbia! Total subject isolation and wonderful tonality to boot!</td>', 'Superblurbia! Total subject isolation and wonderful tonality to boot!', '2011-06-27 14:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6454150, 958821, 10785, '<td valign="top">A great storytelling image capturing modern life but using a vintage feel to give it timelessness. I like the light illuminating her face and the darkness surrounding her. The image grain and all the elements of the room captured only adds to the tale. I am guessing she is a young bachelorette using her newly acquired ipad to seek out that budding online romance~ (but that''s just one story line to tell.)</td>', 'A great storytelling image capturing modern life but using a vintage feel to give it timelessness. I like the light illuminating her face and the darkness surrounding her. The image grain and all the elements of the room captured only adds to the tale. I am guessing she is a young bachelorette using her newly acquired ipad to seek out that budding online romance~ (but that''s just one story line to tell.)', '2011-06-27 14:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
