(6454235, 958873, 114225, '<td valign="top">That''s some very very hard to detect sepia toning. To make sure there was sepia, I used a little color droplet tool. I did find some, but mostly black and white and grey. I bet you are getting hit hard for that.<br/> <br/>Overall, I do like the photo and scene. It feels mysterious.</td>', 'That''s some very very hard to detect sepia toning. To make sure there was sepia, I used a little color droplet tool. I did find some, but mostly black and white and grey. I bet you are getting hit hard for that. Overall, I do like the photo and scene. It feels mysterious.', '2011-06-27 16:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6454239, 958121, 16148, '<td valign="top">Wonderful candid!  Great lighting, DOF, and perfect for sepia.</td>', 'Wonderful candid!  Great lighting, DOF, and perfect for sepia.', '2011-06-27 16:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6454240, 958708, 114225, '<td valign="top">When viewing this image, I find that my eyes first went to the pieces on the top. Those being out of focus, I instantly had a negative reaction Then I finally saw the focused foreground pieces. Combine that with some distracting elements in the upper left and you have only an average photo in my eyes.</td>', 'When viewing this image, I find that my eyes first went to the pieces on the top. Those being out of focus, I instantly had a negative reaction Then I finally saw the focused foreground pieces. Combine that with some distracting elements in the upper left and you have only an average photo in my eyes.', '2011-06-27 16:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6454241, 958565, 114225, '<td valign="top">That''s an interesting tonality for a sepia challenge. Feels more like it''s pushed hard towards yellow (FYI, sepia is an <a href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sepia_%28color%29" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">actual color</a>).<br/> <br/>I like the subject matter, but I feel the straight on composition isn''t highlighting it as well as it could be.</td>', 'That''s an interesting tonality for a sepia challenge. Feels more like it''s pushed hard towards yellow (FYI, sepia is an actual color). I like the subject matter, but I feel the straight on composition isn''t highlighting it as well as it could be.', '2011-06-27 16:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6454244, 958865, 114225, '<td valign="top">The compression effects of the telephoto lens really helps created concentric circles. To me, that''s even more pleasing than a normal inside the dome photo.</td>', 'The compression effects of the telephoto lens really helps created concentric circles. To me, that''s even more pleasing than a normal inside the dome photo.', '2011-06-27 17:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
