(6454760, 958814, 51638, '<td valign="top">Very nice. The face really makes the shot. If it''s a candid, then well spotted. If you set it up, then well done for thinking of it.</td>', 'Very nice. The face really makes the shot. If it''s a candid, then well spotted. If you set it up, then well done for thinking of it.', '2011-06-28 10:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6454762, 958461, 51638, '<td valign="top">I have a nephew in the US who goes to summer camp at ''Camp Chippewa''. This is the only other reference I''ve ever seen to Chippewa. Oh, and effective use of a slow shutter speed BTW. :)</td>', 'I have a nephew in the US who goes to summer camp at ''Camp Chippewa''. This is the only other reference I''ve ever seen to Chippewa. Oh, and effective use of a slow shutter speed BTW. :)', '2011-06-28 10:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6454763, 958385, 51638, '<td valign="top">Nice processing. You''ve managed to use the sepia conversion to enhance the shot, rather than it just looking like an afterthought to meet the challenge. Well done.</td>', 'Nice processing. You''ve managed to use the sepia conversion to enhance the shot, rather than it just looking like an afterthought to meet the challenge. Well done.', '2011-06-28 10:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6454764, 958406, 117474, '<td valign="top">As I said I liked this image a lot and gave it a 7. Tones in the background are nice. Brings out the face. There is a potential point of ''concern'' for people voting whereby they may justify bringing it down as a result of loss of detail/textures in the face, and as it''s a little difficult to find the edge of the nose. Eyes are nice. Not overdone. Nice detail in the iris. Sharpness is great. <br/>A 7 is a good score. I can''t fault it :) But nor could I vote it higher as it didn''t have that zing that I think a photo needs to get higher for me.</td>', 'As I said I liked this image a lot and gave it a 7. Tones in the background are nice. Brings out the face. There is a potential point of ''concern'' for people voting whereby they may justify bringing it down as a result of loss of detail/textures in the face, and as it''s a little difficult to find the edge of the nose. Eyes are nice. Not overdone. Nice detail in the iris. Sharpness is great. A 7 is a good score. I can''t fault it :) But nor could I vote it higher as it didn''t have that zing that I think a photo needs to get higher for me.', '2011-06-28 10:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6454765, 958315, 51638, '<td valign="top">Um, I''m not sure bright blue is usually part of a sepia image. But hey, I''ll pretend I didn''t notice it.</td>', 'Um, I''m not sure bright blue is usually part of a sepia image. But hey, I''ll pretend I didn''t notice it.', '2011-06-28 10:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6454766, 958022, 51638, '<td valign="top">Hmm, this looks like a familiar style. Nice capture (pardon the pun).</td>', 'Hmm, this looks like a familiar style. Nice capture (pardon the pun).', '2011-06-28 10:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6454767, 958919, 51638, '<td valign="top">Great shot, but I''m not sure that extreme sports are really enhanced by sepia tones. Just my opinion of course.</td>', 'Great shot, but I''m not sure that extreme sports are really enhanced by sepia tones. Just my opinion of course.', '2011-06-28 10:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6454770, 958235, 51638, '<td valign="top">If I had to be critical I''d say it looks just a little dark, but that could be my monitor. All in all tho, a great shot that is enhanced by the sepia, rather than looking like and afterthought just to meet the challenge. Front page? Oh, and at the risk of being pedantic, should it be Vicar''s Close?</td>', 'If I had to be critical I''d say it looks just a little dark, but that could be my monitor. All in all tho, a great shot that is enhanced by the sepia, rather than looking like and afterthought just to meet the challenge. Front page? Oh, and at the risk of being pedantic, should it be Vicar''s Close?', '2011-06-28 10:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6454771, 958779, 51638, '<td valign="top">Terrific shot that works really well in sepia.</td>', 'Terrific shot that works really well in sepia.', '2011-06-28 10:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
