(6454774, 958893, 39880, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait of a dog, but I don''t think the sepia works for this.  It would be better in color.</td>', 'Nice portrait of a dog, but I don''t think the sepia works for this.  It would be better in color.', '2011-06-28 10:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6454775, 958686, 51638, '<td valign="top">Considering the surroundings and your processing you really have managed to create a nice vintage feel to this. Your lighting is also wonderful which has created a very flattering shot of an attractive model. The question is tho, how is it going to be received the anti-nude prudes? I''ll give a nice high socre to try to counterbalance some of the inevitable 1''s and 2''s that you''ll no doubt (unfairly) receive.</td>', 'Considering the surroundings and your processing you really have managed to create a nice vintage feel to this. Your lighting is also wonderful which has created a very flattering shot of an attractive model. The question is tho, how is it going to be received the anti-nude prudes? I''ll give a nice high socre to try to counterbalance some of the inevitable 1''s and 2''s that you''ll no doubt (unfairly) receive.', '2011-06-28 10:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6454776, 958699, 51638, '<td valign="top">Cool. Great lighting and PP.</td>', 'Cool. Great lighting and PP.', '2011-06-28 10:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
