(6454815, 958595, 35334, '<td valign="top">Lovely feeling. I admit that I had to look up Pâquerette. Now that I understand the image better, I''m bumping it up.</td>', 'Lovely feeling. I admit that I had to look up Pâquerette. Now that I understand the image better, I''m bumping it up.', '2011-06-28 12:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
