(6454822, 958088, 117534, '<td valign="top">The only thing that bothers me about this is the crop, IMHO I feel like it''s only part of a story, If possible I probaly would''ve left more room in front of the horses, and If I couldn''t get the whole horse in front body, I think I would''ve cropped them at botton of chest before leg and in front of the front horse wither.  I''ve come back to this Several times and sat and looked deep so this isn''t a glance and comment. I love your processing, color, sharpness, capture of the gleam in the eye of the front horse. I''m going to give it a 7, with a diff crop a 8 or 9</td>', 'The only thing that bothers me about this is the crop, IMHO I feel like it''s only part of a story, If possible I probaly would''ve left more room in front of the horses, and If I couldn''t get the whole horse in front body, I think I would''ve cropped them at botton of chest before leg and in front of the front horse wither.  I''ve come back to this Several times and sat and looked deep so this isn''t a glance and comment. I love your processing, color, sharpness, capture of the gleam in the eye of the front horse. I''m going to give it a 7, with a diff crop a 8 or 9', '2011-06-28 12:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6454827, 958321, 117534, '<td valign="top">( I soo want to put nicely done Spiffy) on this..  but if I am wrong.. I still say nicely done!</td>', '( I soo want to put nicely done Spiffy) on this..  but if I am wrong.. I still say nicely done!', '2011-06-28 12:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6454855, 958901, 54778, '<td valign="top">Very poignant image</td>', 'Very poignant image', '2011-06-28 13:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6454861, 958890, 10785, '<td valign="top">Cute! I think a more centered subject would better work here. It''s not really rule of thirds. The soft focus really does go well with the soft and cuddly goose.</td>', 'Cute! I think a more centered subject would better work here. It''s not really rule of thirds. The soft focus really does go well with the soft and cuddly goose.', '2011-06-28 13:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
