(6454866, 958417, 10785, '<td valign="top">Nice use of slow shutter speed to add some dynamic motion to the scene. I think it is a hair bright and a tad red, but overall very good.</td>', 'Nice use of slow shutter speed to add some dynamic motion to the scene. I think it is a hair bright and a tad red, but overall very good.', '2011-06-28 13:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
