(6454869, 958771, 10785, '<td valign="top">You''ve got great softness, but what I think this one lacks is Tonality. Everything is grey... no real highlight and shadows. The veil should make the image muted, but I think something has gone wrong with the PP.</td>', 'You''ve got great softness, but what I think this one lacks is Tonality. Everything is grey... no real highlight and shadows. The veil should make the image muted, but I think something has gone wrong with the PP.', '2011-06-28 14:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6454870, 958627, 10785, '<td valign="top">This is the most colorful sepia toning I have ever scene.</td>', 'This is the most colorful sepia toning I have ever scene.', '2011-06-28 14:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6454871, 958657, 10785, '<td valign="top">This image is really lacking in the brown to orange to red range of tone. It appears B&amp;W to me.</td>', 'This image is really lacking in the brown to orange to red range of tone. It appears B&W to me.', '2011-06-28 14:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6454874, 958385, 10785, '<td valign="top">What''s the Cowboy way... hugging your woman? I think the title is a little misplaced on this one, but that is neither here nor there. You got a good sharp portrait that looks like it would be cherished wherever it is displayed. Good tones add the vintage feel.</td>', 'What''s the Cowboy way... hugging your woman? I think the title is a little misplaced on this one, but that is neither here nor there. You got a good sharp portrait that looks like it would be cherished wherever it is displayed. Good tones add the vintage feel.', '2011-06-28 14:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6454876, 958705, 10785, '<td valign="top">I think this is a little soft in the image definition and could be suffering from hand held camera shake at slow shutter speed??</td>', 'I think this is a little soft in the image definition and could be suffering from hand held camera shake at slow shutter speed??', '2011-06-28 14:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6454882, 958127, 10785, '<td valign="top">Good rhythm and lines made by using the row of feet. The emotion of the shot is definitely portrayed well especially with the toes pointed inward on one of the middle pairs of feet. I think the one thing that takes away from the shot is the open space on the bottom right. I don''t know if you could have changed your angle or your focal length to fill the frame and still end up with a better shot though.</td>', 'Good rhythm and lines made by using the row of feet. The emotion of the shot is definitely portrayed well especially with the toes pointed inward on one of the middle pairs of feet. I think the one thing that takes away from the shot is the open space on the bottom right. I don''t know if you could have changed your angle or your focal length to fill the frame and still end up with a better shot though.', '2011-06-28 14:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6454910, 958576, 10785, '<td valign="top">If the title is any clue, the engine is your focus and here, you have the focus being this hose leading to an out of focus engine. So, I would have used a smaller aperture and had all the image in focus. It still would have had the leading line. At any rate. the details on the focused part are nice and sharp and even though the sepia tone is nearer to black than brown, it still has that brownish/reddish hue, ever so slightly.</td>', 'If the title is any clue, the engine is your focus and here, you have the focus being this hose leading to an out of focus engine. So, I would have used a smaller aperture and had all the image in focus. It still would have had the leading line. At any rate. the details on the focused part are nice and sharp and even though the sepia tone is nearer to black than brown, it still has that brownish/reddish hue, ever so slightly.', '2011-06-28 15:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6454917, 958015, 43774, '<td valign="top">Too washed out/overexposed and not quite in focus. Neat find though.</td>', 'Too washed out/overexposed and not quite in focus. Neat find though.', '2011-06-28 15:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
