(6454973, 958870, 10785, '<td valign="top">Very cute pose and good framing in picture. What''s he hunting for?? I think it is a little shaky due to slight camera movement. Also the sepia toning is really lacking in the red/brown/orange tones.</td>', 'Very cute pose and good framing in picture. What''s he hunting for?? I think it is a little shaky due to slight camera movement. Also the sepia toning is really lacking in the red/brown/orange tones.', '2011-06-28 17:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6454974, 958272, 10785, '<td valign="top">Good capture of the Heron in a somewhat hostile environment sitting there peacefully. I think the reds are a bit too red in your tones. It has bled into the water.</td>', 'Good capture of the Heron in a somewhat hostile environment sitting there peacefully. I think the reds are a bit too red in your tones. It has bled into the water.', '2011-06-28 17:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
