(6454977, 958868, 10785, '<td valign="top">There''s nothing really wrong with the picture''s technicals... good light, good focus, nice range of tones. I think the subject matter is kind of bringing it down for me</td>', 'There''s nothing really wrong with the picture''s technicals... good light, good focus, nice range of tones. I think the subject matter is kind of bringing it down for me', '2011-06-28 17:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6454978, 958686, 40391, '<td valign="top">This is a truelly lovely portrait!  The lighting, pose and location are perfect and the sepia works so well with the image.  The nude is very tasteful and seductive.  My pick of the challenge.  Well done! (bumped to 10)</td>', 'This is a truelly lovely portrait!  The lighting, pose and location are perfect and the sepia works so well with the image.  The nude is very tasteful and seductive.  My pick of the challenge.  Well done! (bumped to 10)', '2011-06-28 17:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6454980, 958595, 40391, '<td valign="top">This image facinates me.  It''s one of the better abstracts I''ve seen for a while.  This deserves to be hanging on a wall of public prominance. (bumping to a 9)</td>', 'This image facinates me.  It''s one of the better abstracts I''ve seen for a while.  This deserves to be hanging on a wall of public prominance. (bumping to a 9)', '2011-06-28 17:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
