(6455047, 958924, 117534, '<td valign="top">OMG the little hamburger guy in the back ground, we grew up with Fishers Hi-Boy and that was the little dude who held the burgers.. just like here! Soo Nostalgic it makes me teary... Only suggestion is the street seems to take away from the "happy-ness" of the burger joint, for me it seems flat n bla, might have tried a crop that took more off the street, or dodge the curbs to draw my eye into the fun part faster.. Any how still a very nice picutre!</td>', 'OMG the little hamburger guy in the back ground, we grew up with Fishers Hi-Boy and that was the little dude who held the burgers.. just like here! Soo Nostalgic it makes me teary... Only suggestion is the street seems to take away from the "happy-ness" of the burger joint, for me it seems flat n bla, might have tried a crop that took more off the street, or dodge the curbs to draw my eye into the fun part faster.. Any how still a very nice picutre!', '2011-06-28 19:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
