(6455527, 958928, 117534, '<td valign="top">I''ve come back to this photo a lot of times before voteing it.. I have a feeling people will underate this shot. I think it''s GREAT, very moody, very in tune for a Sepia tone, Very Artsy.. I say VERY WELL DONE</td>', 'I''ve come back to this photo a lot of times before voteing it.. I have a feeling people will underate this shot. I think it''s GREAT, very moody, very in tune for a Sepia tone, Very Artsy.. I say VERY WELL DONE', '2011-06-29 03:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6455530, 958866, 117534, '<td valign="top">Don''t know where in the world you found old timey base ball players for a Sepia challenge, but OUTSTANDING</td>', 'Don''t know where in the world you found old timey base ball players for a Sepia challenge, but OUTSTANDING', '2011-06-29 03:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6455534, 958557, 113156, '<td valign="top">This has a wonderful feel to it and the tones are just superb.</td>', 'This has a wonderful feel to it and the tones are just superb.', '2011-06-29 04:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6455536, 958865, 117534, '<td valign="top">Very Nice processing, beautiful detail, the only thing that kinda bothers me is the crop... for my taste I would like to see the top and bottom balance but that''s just one girls opinion... Still worth a 7</td>', 'Very Nice processing, beautiful detail, the only thing that kinda bothers me is the crop... for my taste I would like to see the top and bottom balance but that''s just one girls opinion... Still worth a 7', '2011-06-29 04:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6455540, 958811, 117534, '<td valign="top">Different but IMHO it works! love the darker side, kinda erry but happy at the same time!</td>', 'Different but IMHO it works! love the darker side, kinda erry but happy at the same time!', '2011-06-29 04:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6455543, 958376, 117534, '<td valign="top">Errry like something from a sci-fi movie.. LIKE IT</td>', 'Errry like something from a sci-fi movie.. LIKE IT', '2011-06-29 04:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6455544, 957725, 117534, '<td valign="top">This would''ve worked in low key also.. I love low key and sepia sooo gets my Stamp of approval!</td>', 'This would''ve worked in low key also.. I love low key and sepia sooo gets my Stamp of approval!', '2011-06-29 04:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6455621, 958759, 10785, '<td valign="top">I think you really lost the whites in the toning process which makes the image look flat. There is less depth.</td>', 'I think you really lost the whites in the toning process which makes the image look flat. There is less depth.', '2011-06-29 06:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6455789, 958699, 10785, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and wonderful use of form and shape to create something visually "appealing" if I can use a pun. The smaller garlic looks like a snail! Great sepia tones too. Lovely browns!</td>', 'Great lighting and wonderful use of form and shape to create something visually "appealing" if I can use a pun. The smaller garlic looks like a snail! Great sepia tones too. Lovely browns!', '2011-06-29 12:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6455792, 958070, 10785, '<td valign="top">High key and Sepia too! I thought you may be referring to an older image by your title, but apparently not...<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=600519" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/751/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_600519.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/751/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_600519.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/751/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_600519.jpg"/></a></td>', 'High key and Sepia too! I thought you may be referring to an older image by your title, but apparently not... ', '2011-06-29 12:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6455797, 958691, 10785, '<td valign="top">It''s rather a flat image due to the lack of range in tones. Also I think a hand holding the fan would have added a lot to the image!</td>', 'It''s rather a flat image due to the lack of range in tones. Also I think a hand holding the fan would have added a lot to the image!', '2011-06-29 12:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6455803, 958867, 125275, '<td valign="top">This makes me want to see what they are looking at. The brightness of that white dress is a bit overpowering, but I like the clarity of the shot.</td>', 'This makes me want to see what they are looking at. The brightness of that white dress is a bit overpowering, but I like the clarity of the shot.', '2011-06-29 12:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6455807, 958924, 125275, '<td valign="top">Nice vintage feel. These sepia images are making me wonder what a little added graininess would do? I like the dark overall feel to this.</td>', 'Nice vintage feel. These sepia images are making me wonder what a little added graininess would do? I like the dark overall feel to this.', '2011-06-29 12:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6455813, 958678, 125275, '<td valign="top">Interesting looking building. I can''t help but feel the left side is cut off? Nice sepia coloring.</td>', 'Interesting looking building. I can''t help but feel the left side is cut off? Nice sepia coloring.', '2011-06-29 12:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6455822, 958901, 125275, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting idea, although I feel the bird is a bit dark. I do like the vintage dress.</td>', 'This is an interesting idea, although I feel the bird is a bit dark. I do like the vintage dress.', '2011-06-29 12:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6455849, 958597, 125275, '<td valign="top">I feel the brightness of each square is a little overpowering for the subject, and her sunglasses cause a break in eye contact so I am unable to decipher her pose or facial expression. I like the contrast of the blacks.</td>', 'I feel the brightness of each square is a little overpowering for the subject, and her sunglasses cause a break in eye contact so I am unable to decipher her pose or facial expression. I like the contrast of the blacks.', '2011-06-29 13:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6455857, 958548, 125275, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective and nice colors.</td>', 'Interesting perspective and nice colors.', '2011-06-29 13:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6455868, 958707, 125275, '<td valign="top">Nice angle. I wish the DOF were wider so all the girls were in focus. I like the cropping and contrast.</td>', 'Nice angle. I wish the DOF were wider so all the girls were in focus. I like the cropping and contrast.', '2011-06-29 13:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6455872, 958914, 125275, '<td valign="top">I don''t feel the blurriness here adds to the motion of the frog. It actually seems like a radial blur filter, which seems to indicate that the frog is dead rather than moving.</td>', 'I don''t feel the blurriness here adds to the motion of the frog. It actually seems like a radial blur filter, which seems to indicate that the frog is dead rather than moving.', '2011-06-29 13:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6455888, 958695, 125275, '<td valign="top">Interesting border/perspective. Adds to the feeling of a candid shot.</td>', 'Interesting border/perspective. Adds to the feeling of a candid shot.', '2011-06-29 13:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6456025, 958321, 16241, '<td valign="top">audrey hepburn  admiring the view :)</td>', 'audrey hepburn  admiring the view :)', '2011-06-29 16:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6456051, 958080, 114225, '<td valign="top">I really like this scene in sepia. The coloring helps transport you to a different time.</td>', 'I really like this scene in sepia. The coloring helps transport you to a different time.', '2011-06-29 17:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6456055, 958455, 114225, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s almost as close as you can get to B&amp;W with still having the slightest tinge of sepia. I wonder if you are getting voted down for that (I had to use an eye dropper tool to see the sepia).<br/> <br/>This is a cool photo, filled with a lot of conflicting energy. It kind of makes the viewer anxious while looking at it.</td>', 'Wow, that''s almost as close as you can get to B&W with still having the slightest tinge of sepia. I wonder if you are getting voted down for that (I had to use an eye dropper tool to see the sepia). This is a cool photo, filled with a lot of conflicting energy. It kind of makes the viewer anxious while looking at it.', '2011-06-29 17:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6456058, 958710, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very cool symmetry here. What could have made this even better in my mind is if that horizontal line was perfectly straight. The tilt is ruining some of that symmetry for me.</td>', 'Very cool symmetry here. What could have made this even better in my mind is if that horizontal line was perfectly straight. The tilt is ruining some of that symmetry for me.', '2011-06-29 17:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6456060, 958428, 114225, '<td valign="top">An interesting observation I have on this photo is the background elements. With a sepia photo, it often works best to have somewhat of a retro feel. Luckily, the buildings in the background have that. I wonder if that is just lucky or on purpose, as I would expect a photo like this to have depth fo field such that the background is blurred.</td>', 'An interesting observation I have on this photo is the background elements. With a sepia photo, it often works best to have somewhat of a retro feel. Luckily, the buildings in the background have that. I wonder if that is just lucky or on purpose, as I would expect a photo like this to have depth fo field such that the background is blurred.', '2011-06-29 17:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6456063, 958682, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very nice subject for this challenge. I like the perspective. I just wish the building wasn''t visible.</td>', 'Very nice subject for this challenge. I like the perspective. I just wish the building wasn''t visible.', '2011-06-29 17:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6456064, 958417, 114225, '<td valign="top">The blur of the flag add a lot of interest to this scene, and somewhat makes it comes alive.</td>', 'The blur of the flag add a lot of interest to this scene, and somewhat makes it comes alive.', '2011-06-29 17:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6456065, 958644, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very cool effect! I''m about 1/5 of the way through voting, but this is my favorite entry so far.</td>', 'Very cool effect! I''m about 1/5 of the way through voting, but this is my favorite entry so far.', '2011-06-29 17:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6456066, 958779, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great lines, movement, and energy in this scene. It works very well in sepia.</td>', 'Great lines, movement, and energy in this scene. It works very well in sepia.', '2011-06-29 17:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6456067, 958755, 114225, '<td valign="top">Overall, I really like the photo, the setup, the facial expression, and the processing. The one thing that gets me is the glasses. To me, that style of glasses doesn''t seem to fit with the rest of the theme.</td>', 'Overall, I really like the photo, the setup, the facial expression, and the processing. The one thing that gets me is the glasses. To me, that style of glasses doesn''t seem to fit with the rest of the theme.', '2011-06-29 17:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6456068, 958898, 114225, '<td valign="top">I actually believe this photo would have been more powerful without the selective saturation.</td>', 'I actually believe this photo would have been more powerful without the selective saturation.', '2011-06-29 17:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6456069, 958770, 114225, '<td valign="top">What an amazingly cool structure! Combine that with the clouds, the reflections, and the spot on sepia toning and you have yourself a great photo.</td>', 'What an amazingly cool structure! Combine that with the clouds, the reflections, and the spot on sepia toning and you have yourself a great photo.', '2011-06-29 17:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6456071, 958866, 114225, '<td valign="top">Super cool setup! all of the details of this photo are so well thought out and done. I''m however not liking the halo effect around the ball and the people. That''s really distracting for me.</td>', 'Super cool setup! all of the details of this photo are so well thought out and done. I''m however not liking the halo effect around the ball and the people. That''s really distracting for me.', '2011-06-29 17:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6456072, 958686, 114225, '<td valign="top">Even her hair and skin color says vintage/natural. Nicely done.</td>', 'Even her hair and skin color says vintage/natural. Nicely done.', '2011-06-29 18:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6456128, 958614, 134859, '<td valign="top">Absolutely love it.  I have searched high and low for an old truck I could take pictures of... still haven''t found anything worth shooting.  :(</td>', 'Absolutely love it.  I have searched high and low for an old truck I could take pictures of... still haven''t found anything worth shooting.  :(', '2011-06-29 20:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6456176, 958686, 132996, '<td valign="top">This is extremely lovely. The sepia really highlights the softness of her skin. The expression on her face is angelic and the addition of curls really brings a maiden-feel forward. This definitely has a classic nude feel to it.</td>', 'This is extremely lovely. The sepia really highlights the softness of her skin. The expression on her face is angelic and the addition of curls really brings a maiden-feel forward. This definitely has a classic nude feel to it.', '2011-06-29 21:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
