(6456925, 958710, 14476, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see a straight horizon line here, because that''s what we look for in photography.  You might have a reason for the reflective surface being tilted, but it does not come through and adds a slight distraction from the very, very nice scene you have presented.</td>', 'I''d like to see a straight horizon line here, because that''s what we look for in photography.  You might have a reason for the reflective surface being tilted, but it does not come through and adds a slight distraction from the very, very nice scene you have presented.', '2011-06-30 21:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
