(6456928, 958790, 14476, '<td valign="top">You included a LOT of information in this image.  Think about cropping just to the right of that big mid-stream rock (and then to the left, of course), and see how powerful the image becomes.  It must have been a difficult image to capture and easy to see how you wished to show all the majesty involved.</td>', 'You included a LOT of information in this image.  Think about cropping just to the right of that big mid-stream rock (and then to the left, of course), and see how powerful the image becomes.  It must have been a difficult image to capture and easy to see how you wished to show all the majesty involved.', '2011-06-30 21:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6456929, 958887, 14476, '<td valign="top">Lonely lighthouse and tall sparse grasses.  What''s not to like.</td>', 'Lonely lighthouse and tall sparse grasses.  What''s not to like.', '2011-06-30 21:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6456931, 958321, 14476, '<td valign="top">Well done.</td>', 'Well done.', '2011-06-30 21:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
