(6458892, 958127, 118154, '<td valign="top">Nice ,nice ,nice.</td>', 'Nice ,nice ,nice.', '2011-07-02 13:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6458918, 958441, 5885, '<td valign="top">Things I love about this shot: light, tone, processing and that one isolated leaf.<br/> <br/>Things I''m not digging, The out of focus blurred area at the bottom corner. I would have pulled those leaves back for the shot. Also, I think a less wide format would have dramatically helped composition.</td>', 'Things I love about this shot: light, tone, processing and that one isolated leaf. Things I''m not digging, The out of focus blurred area at the bottom corner. I would have pulled those leaves back for the shot. Also, I think a less wide format would have dramatically helped composition.', '2011-07-02 14:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6458921, 958122, 5885, '<td valign="top">Love! Only thing I would''ve changed is the person (or at least I think it''s a person) just right of center frame that is fighting for my attention.</td>', 'Love! Only thing I would''ve changed is the person (or at least I think it''s a person) just right of center frame that is fighting for my attention.', '2011-07-02 14:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6458923, 958389, 5885, '<td valign="top">I really like this!</td>', 'I really like this!', '2011-07-02 14:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6458924, 958898, 5885, '<td valign="top">I really feel the selective saturation on this image hurt you one this one. It''s way to saturated, the flag is too small and centered in the frame for that to be effective.</td>', 'I really feel the selective saturation on this image hurt you one this one. It''s way to saturated, the flag is too small and centered in the frame for that to be effective.', '2011-07-02 14:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6458925, 958829, 5885, '<td valign="top">Great tones, nice processing... good expsoure and lighting... however, composition is just leaving me feeling flat.</td>', 'Great tones, nice processing... good expsoure and lighting... however, composition is just leaving me feeling flat.', '2011-07-02 14:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6458931, 958905, 5885, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but we have both blocked up shadows and blown highlights. It''s a difficult situation, for sure, but not something that can''t be done.</td>', 'Nice composition, but we have both blocked up shadows and blown highlights. It''s a difficult situation, for sure, but not something that can''t be done.', '2011-07-02 14:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6458948, 958548, 119283, '<td valign="top">I like the depth and unknown aspect in the photo.  8</td>', 'I like the depth and unknown aspect in the photo.  8', '2011-07-02 15:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6458949, 958755, 119283, '<td valign="top">it is good. 8</td>', 'it is good. 8', '2011-07-02 15:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6458950, 958771, 119283, '<td valign="top">this is not very good. 4</td>', 'this is not very good. 4', '2011-07-02 15:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6458951, 957754, 119283, '<td valign="top">this is good. 9</td>', 'this is good. 9', '2011-07-02 15:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6458952, 958814, 119283, '<td valign="top">i love it. 10</td>', 'i love it. 10', '2011-07-02 15:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6458953, 957776, 119283, '<td valign="top">Too fancy.  2</td>', 'Too fancy.  2', '2011-07-02 15:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6458954, 958015, 119283, '<td valign="top">i like the tree.  5</td>', 'i like the tree.  5', '2011-07-02 15:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6458955, 958272, 119283, '<td valign="top">This is magical!  9</td>', 'This is magical!  9', '2011-07-02 15:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6458956, 958321, 119283, '<td valign="top">This has good contrast.  7</td>', 'This has good contrast.  7', '2011-07-02 15:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6458957, 958461, 119283, '<td valign="top">I like the soft curves in the water and the shiny rocks.  8</td>', 'I like the soft curves in the water and the shiny rocks.  8', '2011-07-02 15:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6459055, 958176, 18367, '<td valign="top">I am impressed.  I know only too well how difficult getting a shot like this is... and you have done a remarkable job.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I am impressed.  I know only too well how difficult getting a shot like this is... and you have done a remarkable job.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2011-07-02 19:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6459058, 958815, 125275, '<td valign="top">This image seems a little dark. The color fits well though.</td>', 'This image seems a little dark. The color fits well though.', '2011-07-02 19:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6459060, 958728, 125275, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful and crisp. Nice sepia tones.</td>', 'This is beautiful and crisp. Nice sepia tones.', '2011-07-02 19:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6459061, 957754, 125275, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if others will like the brightness on the eye, but I think it suits this image. It appropriately draws the attention in to the subject. Also, the candidness and background of this shot as well as the lighting (local dodging and burning?) make it a very nice sepia image.</td>', 'I''m not sure if others will like the brightness on the eye, but I think it suits this image. It appropriately draws the attention in to the subject. Also, the candidness and background of this shot as well as the lighting (local dodging and burning?) make it a very nice sepia image.', '2011-07-02 19:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6459062, 958374, 125275, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and color of this pic. You may have led him to the water, but I bet you didn''t make him drink!</td>', 'I like the composition and color of this pic. You may have led him to the water, but I bet you didn''t make him drink!', '2011-07-02 19:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6459063, 958080, 125275, '<td valign="top">Nice picture. I love the depth in this one. You really brought out the texture in the clouds and grass.</td>', 'Nice picture. I love the depth in this one. You really brought out the texture in the clouds and grass.', '2011-07-02 19:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6459064, 958181, 125275, '<td valign="top">This has a good feel and I like the blur/DOF. I wonder if a grainy/gritty look would help the vintage feel. I like the darkness of the edges.</td>', 'This has a good feel and I like the blur/DOF. I wonder if a grainy/gritty look would help the vintage feel. I like the darkness of the edges.', '2011-07-02 19:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6459065, 958340, 125275, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot that I''d like to see outside of the sepia challenge. Very nice clarity!</td>', 'This is a nice shot that I''d like to see outside of the sepia challenge. Very nice clarity!', '2011-07-02 19:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6459066, 958187, 125275, '<td valign="top">It took me a while to see the bug. I first thought the flower was "so close to the top" of the image. I like the flower against the background sky. That''s a perfectly colored sepia sky.</td>', 'It took me a while to see the bug. I first thought the flower was "so close to the top" of the image. I like the flower against the background sky. That''s a perfectly colored sepia sky.', '2011-07-02 19:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6459067, 958735, 125275, '<td valign="top">This is a nice capture. The darkness of the borders/edges and the nice DOF lead the eye softly to the relaxing subject. The color and DOF work well in this image.</td>', 'This is a nice capture. The darkness of the borders/edges and the nice DOF lead the eye softly to the relaxing subject. The color and DOF work well in this image.', '2011-07-02 19:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6459068, 958920, 125275, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this image and how the grass seems to divide the image in two. Not seeing where the ducks are going seems to add a bit of mystery and interest to their swimming.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this image and how the grass seems to divide the image in two. Not seeing where the ducks are going seems to add a bit of mystery and interest to their swimming.', '2011-07-02 19:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6459069, 957725, 125275, '<td valign="top">This is tad bit dark, even in the middle, but I like the idea. I also really like the graininess of this image.</td>', 'This is tad bit dark, even in the middle, but I like the idea. I also really like the graininess of this image.', '2011-07-02 19:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6459070, 958873, 125275, '<td valign="top">This is awesome. Nice and clear and well balanced.</td>', 'This is awesome. Nice and clear and well balanced.', '2011-07-02 19:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6459071, 958680, 125275, '<td valign="top">Very interesting processing. Really adds to the DOF and almost gives it a feeling of movement.</td>', 'Very interesting processing. Really adds to the DOF and almost gives it a feeling of movement.', '2011-07-02 19:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6459072, 958693, 125275, '<td valign="top">*gulp* I feel small.<br/>Nice tones and contrast here. Really pops out the <strike>big</strike> little guy.</td>', '*gulp* I feel small.Nice tones and contrast here. Really pops out the big little guy.', '2011-07-02 19:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6459073, 957966, 125275, '<td valign="top">Those clouds look ominous and seem to pose this building in an intimidating fashion. The rays also seem to be pointing to the building. Nice perspective.</td>', 'Those clouds look ominous and seem to pose this building in an intimidating fashion. The rays also seem to be pointing to the building. Nice perspective.', '2011-07-02 19:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6459074, 958433, 125275, '<td valign="top">This is a nice sepia image. I kind of feel the vignette is causing a bit of loss of detail in areas my eyes want to trace, but I like the coloring and shading overall.</td>', 'This is a nice sepia image. I kind of feel the vignette is causing a bit of loss of detail in areas my eyes want to trace, but I like the coloring and shading overall.', '2011-07-02 19:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6459075, 958814, 125275, '<td valign="top">The framing and vignette works perfectly here, as well as the brightness of the face. Only seeing half the face really adds to the expression...if that makes sense.</td>', 'The framing and vignette works perfectly here, as well as the brightness of the face. Only seeing half the face really adds to the expression...if that makes sense.', '2011-07-02 19:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6459076, 958460, 125275, '<td valign="top">This is a nice capture and the sepia seems to help add to the simplicity of the tones.</td>', 'This is a nice capture and the sepia seems to help add to the simplicity of the tones.', '2011-07-02 19:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6459077, 958704, 125275, '<td valign="top">Nice clarity and tones. I like seeing all the detail in the structure, including the fact that it''s all in focus from the bottom to the top.</td>', 'Nice clarity and tones. I like seeing all the detail in the structure, including the fact that it''s all in focus from the bottom to the top.', '2011-07-02 19:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6459078, 958809, 125275, '<td valign="top">Nice subtle sepia tones and framing. The sky is a wonderful, rich dark tone. I take that back, the moose looks fine. :-D</td>', 'Nice subtle sepia tones and framing. The sky is a wonderful, rich dark tone. I take that back, the moose looks fine. :-D', '2011-07-02 19:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6459079, 958828, 125275, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting perspective and fits the sepia challenge nicely. The middle dark spot seems a bit intrusive, but the vertical composition and detail in the sky/clouds is nice.</td>', 'This is a very interesting perspective and fits the sepia challenge nicely. The middle dark spot seems a bit intrusive, but the vertical composition and detail in the sky/clouds is nice.', '2011-07-02 19:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6459080, 958121, 125275, '<td valign="top">I like the DOF and composition of this.</td>', 'I like the DOF and composition of this.', '2011-07-02 19:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6459081, 957758, 125275, '<td valign="top">I like the added noise/grain here, and the subject is perfectly suited for this challenge.</td>', 'I like the added noise/grain here, and the subject is perfectly suited for this challenge.', '2011-07-02 19:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6459082, 958666, 125275, '<td valign="top">The softness of focus and the border work well with the sepia in this image.</td>', 'The softness of focus and the border work well with the sepia in this image.', '2011-07-02 19:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6459083, 958182, 125275, '<td valign="top">I like the clarity of this as well as the arrangement of items.</td>', 'I like the clarity of this as well as the arrangement of items.', '2011-07-02 19:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6459084, 958879, 125275, '<td valign="top">I like the straight on capture of this, although I''m not sure the border works well with the vignette. I like the vignette alone. I like the subject itself, of course.</td>', 'I like the straight on capture of this, although I''m not sure the border works well with the vignette. I like the vignette alone. I like the subject itself, of course.', '2011-07-02 19:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6459085, 958576, 125275, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you are getting comments that this is not sepia. I''m not totally sure about that as I am no scientist or color-ologist. I will say that this DOF is awesome and I love the clarity and texture of this image. It really shines above a lot of other entries. That might be because it''s not sepia.<br/> <br/>(For what it''s worth, I''m probably spending way too much time on this, but I put this in photoshop and used the eye dropper tool with a 101x101px color sample. I got <a href="//www.color-hex.com/color/70685d" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">#70685d</a> on the mesh and <a href="//www.color-hex.com/color/4d473e" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">#4d473e</a> on the engine.)<br/> <br/>Still, 7.</td>', 'I''m sure you are getting comments that this is not sepia. I''m not totally sure about that as I am no scientist or color-ologist. I will say that this DOF is awesome and I love the clarity and texture of this image. It really shines above a lot of other entries. That might be because it''s not sepia. (For what it''s worth, I''m probably spending way too much time on this, but I put this in photoshop and used the eye dropper tool with a 101x101px color sample. I got #70685d on the mesh and #4d473e on the engine.) Still, 7.', '2011-07-02 19:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6459086, 958790, 125275, '<td valign="top">I like the smoothness of the running water here.</td>', 'I like the smoothness of the running water here.', '2011-07-02 19:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6459087, 958125, 125275, '<td valign="top">Mmmm. Coffee colored picture of coffee. Me like.</td>', 'Mmmm. Coffee colored picture of coffee. Me like.', '2011-07-02 19:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6459088, 958887, 125275, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple and well done.</td>', 'Nice and simple and well done.', '2011-07-02 19:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6459089, 958874, 125275, '<td valign="top">The wood grains and textures look nice here, as does the light from the lamps. I''m not too interested in the furniture, which unfortunately is the subject, but I like the feeling of the image. You seem to have captured the feeling of a nice cool night outside.</td>', 'The wood grains and textures look nice here, as does the light from the lamps. I''m not too interested in the furniture, which unfortunately is the subject, but I like the feeling of the image. You seem to have captured the feeling of a nice cool night outside.', '2011-07-02 19:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6459090, 958702, 125275, '<td valign="top">I like the border and contrast of the main dog. I do feel the 2nd dog and leg/arm is a bit distracting. The left side of the image flows nicely to an interesting dog, however the right side of the image is a bit busy and distracting.</td>', 'I like the border and contrast of the main dog. I do feel the 2nd dog and leg/arm is a bit distracting. The left side of the image flows nicely to an interesting dog, however the right side of the image is a bit busy and distracting.', '2011-07-02 19:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6459091, 958755, 125275, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and pose although I wish her face was a bit brigher/sharper. Even if her eyes were *slightly* brighter, I think this would be a stronger image. The framing and pose are great.</td>', 'I like the lighting and pose although I wish her face was a bit brigher/sharper. Even if her eyes were *slightly* brighter, I think this would be a stronger image. The framing and pose are great.', '2011-07-02 19:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6459092, 958750, 125275, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting through the grass. I''m not sure what the pose is doing for this image.</td>', 'I like the lighting through the grass. I''m not sure what the pose is doing for this image.', '2011-07-02 19:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6459093, 957711, 125275, '<td valign="top">Very interesting a nicely framed. Seems the sharpening is giving a bit of a dark edge around the bird''s mouth.</td>', 'Very interesting a nicely framed. Seems the sharpening is giving a bit of a dark edge around the bird''s mouth.', '2011-07-02 19:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6459094, 958708, 125275, '<td valign="top">This seems a little rosy, but I like the tight crop. I wonder what''s up with the headless dude! :-D</td>', 'This seems a little rosy, but I like the tight crop. I wonder what''s up with the headless dude! :-D', '2011-07-02 19:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6459095, 958714, 125275, '<td valign="top">This is a nice moment and is definitely a great subject for the sepia challenge. Seems a tad over sharpened, but it''s not hurting the image. It just seems the grass has a lot of texture that draws the eye away from the boy. Looks like a fun shot!</td>', 'This is a nice moment and is definitely a great subject for the sepia challenge. Seems a tad over sharpened, but it''s not hurting the image. It just seems the grass has a lot of texture that draws the eye away from the boy. Looks like a fun shot!', '2011-07-02 19:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6459096, 958387, 125275, '<td valign="top">Nice tones and exposure. I wonder if a little contrast could make this portrait really pop?</td>', 'Nice tones and exposure. I wonder if a little contrast could make this portrait really pop?', '2011-07-02 19:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6459097, 958223, 125275, '<td valign="top">This image feels peaceful to look at. My eye feels like the wind and scoots over the surface of the grass.</td>', 'This image feels peaceful to look at. My eye feels like the wind and scoots over the surface of the grass.', '2011-07-02 19:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6459098, 958705, 125275, '<td valign="top">This is a nice and clear capture and the subject works well with the sepia.</td>', 'This is a nice and clear capture and the subject works well with the sepia.', '2011-07-02 19:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6459099, 958385, 125275, '<td valign="top">This is a nicely done sepia portrait. The highlights are a little bright on their faces (maybe emphasized by sharpening?), kinda makes them look like they have shiny skin, but I like the background and vignette.</td>', 'This is a nicely done sepia portrait. The highlights are a little bright on their faces (maybe emphasized by sharpening?), kinda makes them look like they have shiny skin, but I like the background and vignette.', '2011-07-02 19:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6459100, 958899, 125275, '<td valign="top">This is a nice, clear shot. Not necessarily improved by sepia, but definitely not hurting it. The focus on the left seems sharper, but I imagine it''s hard to shoot at a smaller aperture in such a dark location. Nice clarity for such a dark shot.</td>', 'This is a nice, clear shot. Not necessarily improved by sepia, but definitely not hurting it. The focus on the left seems sharper, but I imagine it''s hard to shoot at a smaller aperture in such a dark location. Nice clarity for such a dark shot.', '2011-07-02 19:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6459101, 958644, 125275, '<td valign="top">Interesting. Very nice capture of the stars although I''m not sure "midnight" makes sense to me, astronomically speaking. (I''m assuming that''s the moon, but with it so full that seems like it''s closer to right after sunset?)</td>', 'Interesting. Very nice capture of the stars although I''m not sure "midnight" makes sense to me, astronomically speaking. (I''m assuming that''s the moon, but with it so full that seems like it''s closer to right after sunset?)', '2011-07-02 19:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
