(6460400, 958712, 104009, '<td valign="top">8 from me.  i didn''t vote down all the shoehorned entries, but i did score higher for those that had a sepia "feel" to them (meaning subject matter, regardless of the processing), and this was one of the few.  nice job.</td>', '8 from me.  i didn''t vote down all the shoehorned entries, but i did score higher for those that had a sepia "feel" to them (meaning subject matter, regardless of the processing), and this was one of the few.  nice job.', '2011-07-04 01:13:07.000000', NULL, 0),
