(6460402, 958127, 62357, '<td valign="top">Of course this was yours!  Ha.  I should know by now if it''s one of my favourites the chances are it''s you :) Congrats on the top 10.</td>', 'Of course this was yours!  Ha.  I should know by now if it''s one of my favourites the chances are it''s you :) Congrats on the top 10.', '2011-07-04 01:13:30.000000', NULL, 0),
