(6460420, 958121, 124815, '<td valign="top">I wish you would tell me more about this picture. The Name of the Rose, among tens of other thoughts rushed in my head. "A Time of Silence" by Patrick Leigh Fermor.<br/>And mostly a whole world that lives in parallel with ours. Congratulations.<br/>I started too late to vote on this challenge and yours was my second picture to look at and it really stopped me.</td>', 'I wish you would tell me more about this picture. The Name of the Rose, among tens of other thoughts rushed in my head. "A Time of Silence" by Patrick Leigh Fermor.And mostly a whole world that lives in parallel with ours. Congratulations.I started too late to vote on this challenge and yours was my second picture to look at and it really stopped me.', '2011-07-04 01:17:40.000000', NULL, 0),
