(6460797, 957902, 19825, '<td valign="top">This shoot is fantastic. The more you soak it in the more there is to love. The sun on the feet, the textures in the sand and water, the bubbles and footprint, not to mention the great emotion it conveys. 60 out of 171? Pffft. One in a million.</td>', 'This shoot is fantastic. The more you soak it in the more there is to love. The sun on the feet, the textures in the sand and water, the bubbles and footprint, not to mention the great emotion it conveys. 60 out of 171? Pffft. One in a million.', '2011-07-04 09:17:04.000000', NULL, 0),
