(6461280, 958686, 82545, '<td valign="top">When I see pictures like this and scroll down to see 1,2 &amp; 3 ratings for it it makes me wonder if people are just offended by any nudity at all. I agree with everyone else that has said this is a great artistic nude photo. And if anyone that rated this so low sees this comment you should be ashamed of yourselves. The quality of the photo is great, the model is classically beautiful and the lighting is excellent. If people who log onto this site can not handle nudity like this then you should stop visiting and voting. Nude photos have been an art form for as long as there have been cameras and I hope to see more tasteful photos like this.</td>', 'When I see pictures like this and scroll down to see 1,2 & 3 ratings for it it makes me wonder if people are just offended by any nudity at all. I agree with everyone else that has said this is a great artistic nude photo. And if anyone that rated this so low sees this comment you should be ashamed of yourselves. The quality of the photo is great, the model is classically beautiful and the lighting is excellent. If people who log onto this site can not handle nudity like this then you should stop visiting and voting. Nude photos have been an art form for as long as there have been cameras and I hope to see more tasteful photos like this.', '2011-07-04 19:22:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(6461372, 958686, 16148, '<td valign="top">Paul, really well done!  I''ll never understand votes of 1.</td>', 'Paul, really well done!  I''ll never understand votes of 1.', '2011-07-04 21:52:55.000000', NULL, 0),
