(6461505, 958321, 66384, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on a great start here at DPC! Recognition from <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=50695" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Posthumous</a>, two FAVs, and so many glowing comments - all well earned. I love the light and the mood in this image.</td>', 'Congratulations on a great start here at DPC! Recognition from  Posthumous, two FAVs, and so many glowing comments - all well earned. I love the light and the mood in this image.', '2011-07-05 01:24:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(6461509, 958686, 100393, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the great comments and words of support in relation to the ''1 votes. Although some people may have voted ''1 for the nude, I think it is just as likely to be ''1'' because it wasn''t a strong enough sepia tone.<br/> <br/>I won a ribbon with a nude in Black &amp; White IV with no votes of ''1'' and think it was a more challenging image than this one in terms of its content. SO I''ve since come to the conclusion that I can''t assume that 1s for my nude work are given just because it is a nude image - people may just have thought this to be DNMC.<br/> <br/>Thanks again<br/> <br/>Paul</td>', 'Thanks for all the great comments and words of support in relation to the ''1 votes. Although some people may have voted ''1 for the nude, I think it is just as likely to be ''1'' because it wasn''t a strong enough sepia tone. I won a ribbon with a nude in Black & White IV with no votes of ''1'' and think it was a more challenging image than this one in terms of its content. SO I''ve since come to the conclusion that I can''t assume that 1s for my nude work are given just because it is a nude image - people may just have thought this to be DNMC. Thanks again Paul', '2011-07-05 01:33:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(6461536, 958122, 112972, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by noraneko:</b></div><hr/><i> Is this Yellowstone? Great shot! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you, Catherine!  Yes, it is :)  To be exact at the West Thumb Geyser Basin.</td>', 'Originally posted by noraneko: Is this Yellowstone? Great shot!   Thank you, Catherine!  Yes, it is :)  To be exact at the West Thumb Geyser Basin.', '2011-07-05 03:13:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(6461544, 958686, 44825, '<td valign="top">Paul - Don''t worry about the 1s. Its a fabulous photo and beautifully done.<br/> <br/>Incidentally, I have realised that those who score 1s tend to have to write their IQs down just so they can remember how stupid they really are.<br/> <br/>I am truly grateful that the narrow minded have no consistent influence over art.</td>', 'Paul - Don''t worry about the 1s. Its a fabulous photo and beautifully done. Incidentally, I have realised that those who score 1s tend to have to write their IQs down just so they can remember how stupid they really are. I am truly grateful that the narrow minded have no consistent influence over art.', '2011-07-05 03:44:03.000000', NULL, 0),
