(6462549, 958735, 93565, '<td valign="top">Very much like this one, Michelle. You''ve perfectly captured that sepia look, along with the nostalgia of times gone and an excellent moody and aged look. Great job- love the limited DoF on this... it really adds a dreamy-fading memory-sort of feel.</td>', 'Very much like this one, Michelle. You''ve perfectly captured that sepia look, along with the nostalgia of times gone and an excellent moody and aged look. Great job- love the limited DoF on this... it really adds a dreamy-fading memory-sort of feel.', '2011-07-06 02:11:51.000000', NULL, 0),
