(6508239, 958686, 63244, '<td valign="top">OMG, this is the challenge that none of my comments showed up in!!! I loved this photograph in every aspect! Your lighting, composition, model pose, location...all of it is absolutely superb!! I gave you a 10 and faved this! I am just sorry that my comments didn''t come through (none of them did). Beautiful work! Print worthy for sure (with permission). : }</td>', 'OMG, this is the challenge that none of my comments showed up in!!! I loved this photograph in every aspect! Your lighting, composition, model pose, location...all of it is absolutely superb!! I gave you a 10 and faved this! I am just sorry that my comments didn''t come through (none of them did). Beautiful work! Print worthy for sure (with permission). : }', '2011-08-18 11:25:23.000000', NULL, 0),
